When I take a wizard to the bottom of the mines I expect to
land in the middle of a crowd.  I take all the darts, arrows, bolts
and daggers I can carry.  I drop down the stairs, machine-gun
down as many monsters as I can until I get in trouble, I retreat
back up the stairs to heal.  Lather rinse repeat.  Each time
cast a couple of spells, throw a lot of missiles, kill a couple
monsters, retreat to heal.  It doesn't take all that many cycles
before the crowd is gone and the exploration starts.

But you haven't been throwing and casting enough so you
need more melee strength because you're using melee more
often.

